WEBVTT

00:01:59.484 --> 00:02:01.618
we could deploy it anywhere.

00:02:01.618 --> 00:02:03.734
You don't need to go to the chemist anymore.

00:02:03.734 --> 00:02:06.102
We can print drugs at point of need.

00:02:06.102 --> 00:02:08.757
We can download new diagnostics.

00:02:08.757 --> 00:02:10.768
Say a new super bug has emerged.

00:02:10.768 --> 00:02:12.385
You put it in your search engine,

00:02:12.385 --> 00:02:15.518
and you create the drug to treat the threat.

00:02:15.518 --> 00:02:19.206
So this allows you on-the-fly molecular assembly.

00:02:19.206 --> 00:02:22.201
But perhaps for me the core bit going into the future

00:02:22.201 --> 00:02:25.551
is this idea of taking your own stem cells,

00:02:25.551 --> 00:02:27.318
with your genes and your environment,

00:02:27.318 --> 00:02:30.767
and you print your own personal medicine.